# Confessions of Royalty with its SoA era module (modules/era/lua/missions/mission_adjustments.lua, RESTRICT_CONTENT 1,
# ENABLE_SOA 0): the 564 finish also sets the mission's Timer var until JST midnight (on completion, option 1 only).
# Halver 564, option 0: nothing; option 1: the letter deleted, completed, Timer 1 (setVar with an expiry).
module modules/era/lua/missions/mission_adjustments.lua
lists ChateauDoraguille/Halver/onTrigger ChateauDoraguille/onEventFinish/564
char zone=ChateauDoraguille pos=0,0,-10 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Toau ConfessionsOfRoyalty current
keyitem RaillefalsLetter
rank 3
setting RESTRICT_CONTENT 1
setting ENABLE_SOA 0
login
trigger Halver                          # 564
finish option=0                         # nothing
trigger Halver
finish option=1                         # completed, Timer 1
